# Assignment5SDP — Strategy Pattern

Assignment #5, ShP-2216 Software Design Patterns (Astana IT University).

## Idea
`Navigator` (Context) plans a route using interchangeable `RouteStrategy`
implementations: car, walk, cycle, public transport. The strategy can be
switched at runtime.

## Structure
- `RouteStrategy` — strategy interface
- `CarStrategy`, `WalkStrategy`, `CycleStrategy`, `PublicTransportStrategy` — concrete strategies
- `Navigator` — context, delegates to the current strategy
- `Route` — immutable result of planning
- `Main` — client, selects strategies

## Run
JDK 17. Open the project in IntelliJ IDEA and run `Main`, or:

    javac -d out src/Main.java src/navigation/*.java
    java -cp out Main

## Adding a new strategy
Create a class implementing `RouteStrategy`. No existing class needs to change.